Our game finishes.
We all take our bags.
I am very tired.
But I am very happy.
Sara smiles at me.
"Maya, you can play very well," Sara says.
"Thank you very much, Sara," I say.
"I like to play badminton very much."
Kiran puts his racket in the bag.
"Maya, are you coming again next week?" Kiran asks.
"Yes, definitely," I reply.
"I like to play with you all," I add.
Vishnu smiles happily.
"That is good," Vishnu says.
"We also like to play with you."
I return the racket.
We all say goodbye.
Now I am going home.
Next week I am going to play badminton again!
Tonight I will be able to sleep well!
